            "review_title": "Review at Com Heo Quay",
            "review_text": "billcoo\nSan Angelo, Texas253 contributions\n1\nExcellent Restaurant\nFeb 2018 • Family\nHad the bbq pork ribs, fried whole fish, Vietnamese bbq pork and the green beans, all were very good. Been there several times during our past 2 visits to Bien Hoa. No English is spoken, one can easily point and order using hand signals, prices are reasonable, worth a try if in Bien Hoa.\nWritten March 30, 2018",
